# This repository stores its text blobs with CRLF (that is how upstream committed
# them). With core.autocrlf=true git strips CR before diffing, so every line of
# every file compared as modified - MainWindow.xaml.cs showed a ~9000 line diff
# for ~35 lines of real change.
#
# Disabling conversion outright is the fix. Renormalizing to LF instead would
# rewrite ~37k lines plus templates/gallery.json, and because this is a fork it
# would make every future merge from upstream conflict on every line.
* -text

# Assets served straight from this repo as the gallery CDN, plus BinaryFormatter
# payloads. Marked binary so no tool is ever tempted to line-ending or diff them.
*.template binary
*.turtheme binary
*.lltheme  binary
*.zip      binary

*.png  binary
*.jpg  binary
*.jpeg binary
*.bmp  binary
*.gif  binary
*.ico  binary

*.ttf binary
*.otf binary

*.mp4  binary
*.h264 binary
*.avi  binary

*.dll binary
*.exe binary
*.pdb binary

# Nicer function context in C# hunks.
*.cs diff=csharp
